---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Trading card project ??" windowTitle="web project" showCloseBtn={true}>
  <div class="projectWindow ">
                  
                  
    <div class="lg-4" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox jc">
        <p>I designed a trading card game mockup on a random hot and humid day, inspired by my favorite childhood TCG, but with a unique twist.</p>
        <p>This card game concept tackles the political scene in Taiwan and how it impacts our daily lives. By playing the game, players can gain a deeper understanding of the complexities of politics and its effects on society.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-8" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img  class="lazy" src="../media/small/cg-1.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/cg-1.webp" alt="">
      </div>
      <h6 class="caption">These were scenes that actually happened.</h6>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-8 lg-offset-2" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img  class="lazy" src="../media/small/cg-2.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/cg-2.webp" alt="">
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-12" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img  class="lazy" src="../media/small/cg-4.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/cg-4.webp" alt="">
      </div> 
      <h6 class="caption">These are mockups of cards that I created using Adobe XD.</h6>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox je">
        <p>I designed a mockup of a trading card game inspired by the neumorphism design trend, which combines elements of skeuomorphism and flat design. This design trend is known for its soft, extruded plastic look that mimics physical objects, creating a sense of depth through shadows and highlights.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-6" data-inView="slideIn">
      <div class="textbox je">
        <p>Neumorphism is popular for its minimalist aesthetic and focus on simplicity and usability.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="lg-12" data-inView="slideInRight">
      <div class="bitFilter">
        <img  class="lazy" src="../media/small/cg-3.png" data-hiResImg="../media/design/cg-3.webp" alt="">
      </div> 
    </div>


    
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
